<title>USA: Kerr-McGee Corp Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Kerr-McGee Corp Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.45		    $0.94</p>
<p> Net			 70,200		   47,900</p>
<p> Sales		    468,000		  454,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  48,064		   50,562</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 results include after-tax equity earnings of $10 million, and a $2 million after-tax gain from the sale of equity securities.</p>
<p>First Call estimate for Q1 1997 was $1.28 a share.</p>
</text>
